### 3.4 Assign hospital + schedule to appointment — PROTECTED — STAFF JWT — PATCH /api/staff/appointments/:id/schedule
# A. Valid Staff token → 200 (if appointment and schedule valid)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/appointments/1/schedule
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

{
  "hospital_id": 1,
  "schedule_id": 1
}

### 3.4B No token → 401
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/appointments/1/schedule
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hospital_id": 1,
  "schedule_id": 1
}

### 3.4C Invalid token → 401
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/appointments/1/schedule
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token

{
  "hospital_id": 1,
  "schedule_id": 1
}

### 3.4D Wrong role (Doctor) → 403
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/appointments/1/schedule
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

{
  "hospital_id": 1,
  "schedule_id": 1
}

