### 5.1 Patient view doctor schedules — PUBLIC — GET /api/patients/doctors/1/schedules
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/doctors/1/schedules

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. Staff Notifications — PROTECTED + OWNERSHIP — STAFF JWT
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Staff must use own staff_id from JWT (req.user.staff_id), not URL alone
# Flow: authMiddleware (401 if no/invalid) → roleMiddleware("staff") (403 if doctor/patient) → controller checks String(req.params.id) === String(req.user.staff_id) (403 if other staff)

### 6.1 Own notifications → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/staff/{{staffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 6.2 Another Staff's notifications → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/staff/{{otherStaffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
# Expect 403 { message: "Access denied. You can only access your own notifications." }

### 6.3 No token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/staff/{{staffId}}
# No Authorization — expect 401

### 6.4 Invalid token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/staff/{{staffId}}
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token

### 6.5 Doctor token → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/staff/{{staffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

